        <ol>
          <li>UOG Library accounts are not transferable and are only to be used by the person registered in the account.</li>
          <li>Account holders are responsible for the proper care and return of materials.</li>
          <li>Account holders are responsible for any overdue fines for lost, damaged, and processing charges.</li>
