          <li>Inform the Library of changes in personal information, such as current mailing address, phone number, and email address.</li>
          <li>Unpaid fees and fines on all library accounts will be forwarded to the University of Guam's Collections Office.</li>
          <li>Outstanding fines or fees on student accounts will result in a hold on your library account, barring registration, receipt of grades, and transcripts.</li>
        </ol>
